{"id":"u-3ff47332-9f3f-4557-95eb-30f9b8021fa1","src":"community","title":"16 Week Microcycle","author":"Aaron LaRue","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/rIcsDU-16-week-microcycle","desc":"A 16-week reverse pyramid training cycle built for sustainable strength progression in lifters who want to train hard for decades, not burn out in months. Three sessions per week, five compound lifts every session, structured around a 12-week maintenance block plus a 4-week push phase. Two strategic deload weeks built in (Weeks 6 and 12) to protect connective tissue and preserve recovery capacity.\nHeaviest set first when the nervous system is fresh, then descending volume across two back-off sets at lower percentages. This is the classic Greek God / Hollywood physique training approach used by Mark Twight, Martin Berkhan, and the 300 cast — adapted for lifters with demanding careers, families, and the goal of holding 12-13% body fat year-round without bulk/cut cycles.\nUpdate your 1RM input every 16 weeks and run the cycle again. Your strength climbs ~10 lbs per lift per cycle (~30 lbs per year) without ever grinding to failure or chasing weekly PRs. Built for the long game.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-10T04:07:31.852Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Military Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":33},{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":94},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"pct":82},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":76}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":33},{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":96},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"pct":86},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":79}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":33},{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":94},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"pct":82},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":76}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":33},{"lo":4,"hi":6,"pct":96},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"pct":88},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":80}]},{"n":"De